  "title": "Signal PDU: Adding hex display for raw uint values",
  "description": "It is a common use case to look at the signal raw values in hex.\nThis patch adds this for uint based values. Since the length of\nthe signal is not necessary 8, 16, 32, or 64 bit, this is done via\nappend_text.",
